$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2fmvu  LOC_AFTER=?

* The mover with one field of the internal state pinned: with ` U ` a state function (Lean's ` flag ` , ` cmp ` , ` carry ` as projections of ` TMSt ` ) which the pop handler preserves, the mover leaves ` ( U ` v ) ` unchanged.  ~ tm2fmvn at ` N = { q e. ( 2nd ` T ) | ( U ` q ) = O } ` ; the state class must bind a variable other than ` r ` and ` z ` , which ~ tm2fmvn's distinct-variable conditions exclude.

